# Web API (apps/web).
# - Expo web (browser): http://localhost:3000 is fine (mobile rewrites LAN→localhost automatically).
# - Physical phone: use your *Windows* Wi-Fi IPv4 (ipconfig), not WSL's eth0 IP.
# - On WSL2, Expo Go LAN/QR often fails — use `npm run dev:mobile:tunnel` from repo root.
# - Store / TestFlight builds: https://… production API — see EXPO_DEPLOYMENT.md
# - Optional: EXPO_PUBLIC_LOG_LEVEL=debug (or LOG_LEVEL)
# Example: EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.10:3000
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Website origin for “buy / manage Pro on the web” (defaults to API URL).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_WEB_ORIGIN=https://weather.example.com

# In-app Stripe Checkout (opens system browser + returns via solviax://).
# Dev / Expo Go: omit or set 1. Store / TestFlight / Play: set 0.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ALLOW_STRIPE_CHECKOUT=1
